WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
One domino run, remade in glass, ice and paper.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
[Wood dominoes clatter as they fall]

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:16.000
[Glass dominoes chime as they fall]

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:21.000
[Ice dominoes crackle as they fall]

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:26.000
[Paper dominoes thud softly as they fall]

00:00:26.000 --> 00:00:32.106
Same prompt every time. The sound follows the material.
